# Athenura Billing System

Athenura is a billing management system developed to handle billing related operations.
This project focuses on managing products, customers and generating billing data.

## Technologies Used

- Java
- Spring Boot
- Spring Data JPA
- Hibernate
- MySQL
- REST API
- Cloudinary Api

## Features

- Manage products
- Manage customer details
- Create billing records
- Store and retrieve billing information
- CRUD operations using REST APIs
- Pdf Genrating

## Project Structure

The application is divided into:

Controller - API handling  
Service - Business logic  
Repository - Database interaction  

## How To Run

1. Clone the repository
2. Configure MySQL database
3. Start the Spring Boot application
